>## Show a type constraint as a string
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term typeConstraint = λtc.let ltyp := typing.TypeConstraint[`left`] tc, rtyp := typing.TypeConstraint[`right`] tc in strings.concat [print.model.type ltyp, "≡", print.model.type rtyp]
